          | sum-of-squares:                            |
global -->| square:                                    |
env       | f: --+                                     |
          +------|--------------+--------------+-------+
                 |     ^        |     ^        |     ^
                 |     |        |     |        |     |
                 V     |        V     |        V     |
             .---.---. |    .---.---. |    .---.---. |
             | O | O-+-+    | O | O-+-+    | O | O-+-+
             `-|-^---'      `-|-^---'      `-|-^---'
               |              |              |
               V              V              V
   parameters: a          parameters: x  parameters: x, y
   body: sum-of-squares(  body: x·x  body: square(x) +
           a + 1,                                square(y)
           2·a)
@end example
@end ifinfo
